Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<strong>Spherical coordinates (ρ, θ, φ)</strong>
<label>ρ (radial distance) = <span id="sv-rho">4.0</span>
  <input type="range" id="rho" min="0.5" max="6" step="0.1" value="4"></label>
