// x-axis → Line + ConeGeometry arrowhead, #222, fig +X → world +X, len 7
// y-axis → Line + Cone, fig +Y → world +Z, len 7
// z-axis → Line + Cone, fig +Z → world +Y, len 7
// P       → SphereGeometry(0.11) black at (ρ sinφ cosθ, ρ sinφ sinθ, ρ cosφ)
// P label → two-line addLabel right of P: 'P(x, y, z)' / 'P(ρ, θ, φ)' BIG BOLD
// ρ line  → CylinderGeometry origin→P, #1a5caa, radius 0.04
// φ arc   → sampled Line (r=1.2) via fat tube segments + cone arrowhead, z-axis → OP
// θ arc   → sampled Line (r=1.2) in xy-plane via fat tube segments + cone arrowhead, x → ground seg
// z drop  → dashed orange segment chain of cylinders, P → (x, y, 0)
// r line  → dashed orange segment chain of cylinders, origin → (x, y, 0)
